{
  "title": { "zh": "指定画哪边" },
  "tray": "generative",
  "after": {
    "zh": "多给生成器一个条件输入，它就按要求画：这叫条件生成。「画一只猫」「画成水彩风格」这些文字提示，就是更复杂的条件。"
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "生成器画出来的东西是随机的。要让它按要求画，得多告诉它一点什么。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关你要做的：c = 0 时在左边那一带画斑点，c = 1 时在右边。"
      },
      "fig": { "test": 0, "caption": { "zh": "第一组：左边" } }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "8-9",
      "kind": "graph",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "c = 0 时，从左边那一带抽一个斑点；c = 1 时，从右边那一带抽。"
      },
      "hint": {
        "zh": "同样的抽样，只是中心换了。中心能不能由 c 算出来？"
      },
      "inputs": ["eps", "c", "left", "right", "sigma"],
      "inputLabels": {
        "eps": { "zh": "噪声 ε" },
        "c": { "zh": "画哪边 c（0 左，1 右）" },
        "left": { "zh": "左边的中心" },
        "right": { "zh": "右边的中心" },
        "sigma": { "zh": "散开 σ" }
      },
      "check": { "tolerance": 0.05, "mismatches": 2 },
      "scene": "sides",
      "setup": { "left": [-1, 0], "right": [1, 0], "sigma": [0.3, 0.3] },
      "tests": [
        { "label": { "zh": "左边" }, "eps": [0.014608022670355346, 1.023152153693789], "c": 0 },
        { "label": { "zh": "右边" }, "eps": [2.6198792344586073, -0.3578478790713314], "c": 1 },
        { "label": { "zh": "又是右边" }, "eps": [0.9199123669572353, -1.7435470447785244], "c": 1 }
      ],
      "hidden": [{ "label": { "zh": "又是左边" }, "eps": [0.0390086011845821, 0.9110642857758415], "c": 0 }],
      "solution": [
        "one = const()",
        "oc = arith[op=sub](one, c)",
        "wr = arith[op=mul](right, c)",
        "wl = arith[op=mul](left, oc)",
        "mu = arith[op=add](wl, wr)",
        "r = dg_reparam(mu, sigma, eps)",
        "d = dg_decoder(r)",
        "out <- d"
      ],
      "naive": ["r = dg_reparam(left, sigma, eps)", "d = dg_decoder(r)", "out <- d"]
    }
  ]
}
